    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/6bdd4d9a210f47c50759c84f6d4df2c3.avif?t=1741554840\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/8b350e18be62f6b1f10cdf9b17eebe14.poster.avif?t=1741554840\" width=800 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/8b350e18be62f6b1f10cdf9b17eebe14.webm?t=1741554840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/8b350e18be62f6b1f10cdf9b17eebe14.mp4?t=1741554840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Founders Legacy</i> is a relaxing idle-colony builder designed to sit at the bottom of your screen, allowing you to focus on other activities while growing and managing your settlement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your colony:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple tent and grow your settlement into a flourishing town, eventually constructing a majestic castle. Place structures, manage resources, and guide settlers as they build their lives and expand your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crops and wood to stone and coins, every resource plays a vital role. Balance your stocks, unlock new upgrades, and ensure your colony thrives with careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and prestige:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new possibilities with every cycle of growth. Prestige allows you to reset your settlement, gaining bonuses that make your next colony more efficient and prosperous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking made easy:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Founders Legacy is designed to sit quietly at the bottom of your screen, allowing you to watch videos, browse the internet, write, or play other games while your colony thrives in the background. Zoom in for details or zoom out for a minimalist, distraction-free view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless discovery:</strong><br>Expand your colony, uncover mysteries of the past, and make decisions that shape your settlement\u2019s story. Each playthrough offers new challenges and opportunities to create a legacy that endures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're taking a break, multitasking, or diving deep into the details, <i>Founders Legacy</i> offers a tranquil yet engaging experience tailored to your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/6bdd4d9a210f47c50759c84f6d4df2c3.avif?t=1741554840\" width=616 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/8b350e18be62f6b1f10cdf9b17eebe14.poster.avif?t=1741554840\" width=800 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/8b350e18be62f6b1f10cdf9b17eebe14.webm?t=1741554840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351230/extras/8b350e18be62f6b1f10cdf9b17eebe14.mp4?t=1741554840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Founders Legacy</i> is a relaxing idle-colony builder designed to sit at the bottom of your screen, allowing you to focus on other activities while growing and managing your settlement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your colony:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a simple tent and grow your settlement into a flourishing town, eventually constructing a majestic castle. Place structures, manage resources, and guide settlers as they build their lives and expand your colony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crops and wood to stone and coins, every resource plays a vital role. Balance your stocks, unlock new upgrades, and ensure your colony thrives with careful planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress and prestige:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new possibilities with every cycle of growth. Prestige allows you to reset your settlement, gaining bonuses that make your next colony more efficient and prosperous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multitasking made easy:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Founders Legacy is designed to sit quietly at the bottom of your screen, allowing you to watch videos, browse the internet, write, or play other games while your colony thrives in the background. Zoom in for details or zoom out for a minimalist, distraction-free view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless discovery:</strong><br>Expand your colony, uncover mysteries of the past, and make decisions that shape your settlement\u2019s story. Each playthrough offers new challenges and opportunities to create a legacy that endures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're taking a break, multitasking, or diving deep into the details, <i>Founders Legacy</i> offers a tranquil yet engaging experience tailored to your pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
